<title>BELGIUM: EU invites tenders for vegetable oil food aid.</title>
<headline>EU invites tenders for vegetable oil food aid.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union is inviting tenders for two shipments of 1,000 tonnes of rapeseed or sunflower oil to Tajikistan and Angola, the EU Official Journal said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Tenders for the aid, which will be distributed through the Rome-based World Food Programme, are due to be submitted to the European Commission by May 20.</p>
<p>-Brussels newsroom +322 287 6830</p>
</text>
